# Signal design

Source of truth: `docs/design/design-system.md` and `docs/design/ux-blueprint.md`. Seeded into `DESIGN.md` at the repo root.

Three ideas on every screen: **documents are the hero**, **pencil vs ink** (AI drafts vs accepted), **every claim has a proof mark**.

One typeface (Manrope), a cool canvas, white surfaces, one indigo brand, soft elevation. Larger controls (44px minimum) and one obvious next action per view.

Never reuse another Kame app's tokens, fonts, icons, or components. Enforcement: `anti-slop-design.mdc`, `/ka-design-review`.
